# No Git LFS is used in this repository.
# Model weights, caches and large CSVs are committed as plain files so that a
# single `git clone` yields a fully runnable package with no extra `git lfs pull`.
# The largest tracked file is 68 MB, below GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
#
# Line-ending normalization is deliberately NOT applied: MANIFEST.sha256 records
# SHA-256 digests of working-tree bytes, so any CRLF conversion would break the
# package's own integrity check. All text files are checked out byte-exact.
* -text
